From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:47:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/23] Mobile: Add multi-notebook filter to tile view

Adds `notes.tileFolderIds` so the tile view can be limited to one or more
notebooks, selected from a checkbox tree dialog (NoteTileFolderDialog)
reachable from a new toolbar above the grid (NoteTileToolbar). Checking a
notebook also checks its descendants and unchecking removes them, matching
the earlier Joplin plugin this feature is based on; the selection logic is
factored into utils/tileFolderSelection.ts so it can be tested directly.

When a filter is set, NoteTileList loads its own notes with Note.previews()
instead of using whatever Joplin currently has loaded into state.notes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0122rnadKkGCFMVkX948oRD8

